<title>USA: Volusia Cty, Fla., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Volusia Cty, Fla., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc., said it won $10 million of Volusia Cty, Fla., sales tax improvement revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.263 percent.</p>
</text>
